JubilifeCity_GlobalTerminal_F3_Text_PtNpc3_0:
	.string "Let me attempt the alphabet rap using\n"
	.string "Jubilife, dig?\p"
	.string "J... Just to the south of this here city\n"
	.string "is Sandgem sitting pretty.\p"
	.string "U... Underneath Oreburgh there’s a coal\n"
	.string "mine doing mighty fine.\p"
	.string "B... Beneath the sea sprawls that mine,\n"
	.string "it’s not anywhere I’d like to be.\p"
	.string "I... In the north you find Floaroma,\n"
	.string "growing flowers for my dear old Ma!\p"
	.string "Yeah, I know, lame-o. You give it a try!$"

